Sure. Here's an updated version of the data endpoint with error handling and a 404 response if the resource is not found.

```python file="api/routes.py"
@bp.route('/data/<int:resource_id>')
def get_data(resource_id):
    resource = Data.query.get(resource_id)
    if resource is None:
        abort(404, description="Resource not found")
    return jsonify(resource.to_dict())
```

